OL,5,G0125 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FOn the night shift, PCs see a
OL,8,     Fdriver with his foot down in a
OL,9,     Ftop-of-the-range vehicle. And
OL,10,     Fafter spotting some cops, a man
OL,11,     Fditches his wheels to make off on
OL,12,     Ffoot.
OL,13,G0220 Police Interceptors
OL,14,     FA suspected drug dealer crashes
OL,15,     Fhis bike into a hedge in a bid to
OL,16,     Fescape. A man wanted for ABH is
OL,17,     Fcaught hiding in a bathroom.
